   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Bir masa oyununda −10’dan 10’a kadar numaralandırılmış karelerden oluşan bir şerit ve üzerlerinde üslü ifadeler yazılı kartlar kullanılmaktadır. Piyon başlangıçta 0 numaralı karededir.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 580 216\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Numaralı kareler şeridi: −10’dan 10’a kadar 21 kare; piyon 0 karesinde. Altında sırayla 5 kart: (−1/2) üssü −3, (−3) kare, −2 kare, (−1) üssü 100 çarpı 5 üssü 0, parantez içinde 2 üssü −1, bunun −3. kuvveti, çarpı 2 üssü −1.\"><text x=\"18\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#475569\">← negatif değer: sola</text><text x=\"562\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#475569\">pozitif değer: sağa →</text><rect x=\"17\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−10</text><rect x=\"43\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−9</text><rect x=\"69\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"82\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−8</text><rect x=\"95\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"108\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−7</text><rect x=\"121\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"134\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−6</text><rect x=\"147\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−5</text><rect x=\"173\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"186\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−4</text><rect x=\"199\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"212\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−3</text><rect x=\"225\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"238\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−2</text><rect x=\"251\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"264\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−1</text><rect x=\"277\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><rect x=\"303\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"316\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1</text><rect x=\"329\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><rect x=\"355\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"368\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3</text><rect x=\"381\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"394\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text><rect x=\"407\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5</text><rect x=\"433\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"446\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">6</text><rect x=\"459\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"472\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">7</text><rect x=\"485\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"498\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">8</text><rect x=\"511\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"524\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">9</text><rect x=\"537\" y=\"68\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">10</text><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"36\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M281 63 L284 47 Q290 42 296 47 L299 63 Z\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"17\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Çekilen kartlar (çekiliş sırasıyla):</text><rect x=\"17\" y=\"132\" width=\"104\" height=\"76\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff6ff\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">1. kart</text><line x1=\"27\" y1=\"157\" x2=\"111\" y2=\"157\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\"/><text x=\"60.2\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"24\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−</text><text x=\"69\" y=\"180.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1</text><line x1=\"63.2\" y1=\"183.4\" x2=\"74.8\" y2=\"183.4\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"198.9\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><text x=\"77.8\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"24\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">)⁻³</text><rect x=\"129\" y=\"132\" width=\"104\" height=\"76\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff6ff\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"181\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">2. kart</text><line x1=\"139\" y1=\"157\" x2=\"223\" y2=\"157\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\"/><text x=\"181\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−3)²</text><rect x=\"241\" y=\"132\" width=\"104\" height=\"76\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff6ff\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"293\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">3. kart</text><line x1=\"251\" y1=\"157\" x2=\"335\" y2=\"157\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\"/><text x=\"293\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−2²</text><rect x=\"353\" y=\"132\" width=\"104\" height=\"76\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff6ff\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"405\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">4. kart</text><line x1=\"363\" y1=\"157\" x2=\"447\" y2=\"157\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\"/><text x=\"405\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−1)¹⁰⁰·5⁰</text><rect x=\"465\" y=\"132\" width=\"104\" height=\"76\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff6ff\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"517\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">5. kart</text><line x1=\"475\" y1=\"157\" x2=\"559\" y2=\"157\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\"/><text x=\"517\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(2⁻¹)⁻³·2⁻¹</text></svg></div><p>Oyuncu kartları şekildeki sırayla çeker ve her karttan sonra piyonu şu kurala göre hareket ettirir:</p><ul><li>Kartın değeri pozitifse piyon, bu değer kadar kare <b>sağa</b> gider.</li><li>Kartın değeri negatifse piyon, bu değerin işaretsiz hâli kadar kare <b>sola</b> gider. (Örneğin değer −3 ise piyon 3 kare sola gider.)</li></ul><p><b>Buna göre beş kart çekildikten sonra piyon kaç numaralı karede durur?</b></p>",
