   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Bir robot, aşağıdaki 12 hücreli zeminde hareket edecektir. Her hücreye bir üslü ifade yazılmıştır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 290\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Üç satır dört sütunluk zemin. 1. satır: (−3) kare, 3 üssü −2, −2 üssü −1, −3 kare. 2. satır: 2 üssü −3, 2 küp, (−1/4) üssü −1, (−2) küp. 3. satır: (−5) üssü 0, (−1) üssü 7, (1/2) üssü −1, (−2) üssü 4. Giriş sol üst hücrede; K çıkışı 1. satırın, L çıkışı 2. satırın sağ ucunda; N çıkışı 1. sütunun, M çıkışı 2. sütunun altında.\"><rect x=\"120\" y=\"40\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−3)²</text><rect x=\"220\" y=\"40\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3⁻²</text><rect x=\"320\" y=\"40\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−2⁻¹</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"40\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−3²</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"104\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2⁻³</text><rect x=\"220\" y=\"104\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2³</text><rect x=\"320\" y=\"104\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"361.5\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"23\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"134.7\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1</text><line x1=\"364.5\" y1=\"137.7\" x2=\"375.5\" y2=\"137.7\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"152.2\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text><text x=\"378.5\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"23\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">)⁻¹</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"104\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−2)³</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"168\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−5)⁰</text><rect x=\"220\" y=\"168\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−1)⁷</text><rect x=\"320\" y=\"168\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"351.9\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"23\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(</text><text x=\"360.3\" y=\"198.7\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1</text><line x1=\"354.9\" y1=\"201.7\" x2=\"365.8\" y2=\"201.7\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"360.3\" y=\"216.2\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><text x=\"368.8\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"23\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">)⁻¹</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"168\" width=\"100\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"21\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−2)⁴</text><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"104\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"102,64 118,72 102,80\" fill=\"#15803d\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#15803d\" font-weight=\"bold\">GİRİŞ</text><line x1=\"522\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"566\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"564,64 580,72 564,80\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><text x=\"546\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">K</text><line x1=\"522\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"566\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"564,128 580,136 564,144\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><text x=\"546\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">L</text><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"234\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"268\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"162,266 170,282 178,266\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">N</text><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"234\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"268\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"262,266 270,282 278,266\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"/><text x=\"256\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">M</text></svg></div><p>Robot, GİRİŞ okunun gösterdiği hücreden harekete başlar ve şu kurallara uyar:</p><ul><li>Her adımda, bulunduğu hücreye yatay ya da dikey olarak komşu olan ve <b>daha önce girmediği</b> hücreler arasından (başlangıç hücresi de girilmiş sayılır), üzerindeki ifadenin <b>değeri en büyük</b> olana geçer.</li><li>Yanında çıkış oku bulunan bir hücreye girdiği anda o çıkıştan dışarı çıkar.</li></ul><p><b>Buna göre robot hangi çıkıştan dışarı çıkar?</b></p>",
