   "q": "<p>Bir sınıf panosu, kenar uzunluğu 2<sup>3</sup> cm olan kare biçimindeki 8 eş fayans, aralarında boşluk kalmayacak ve üst üste gelmeyecek şekilde yan yana dizilerek yapılmıştır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 440 212\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"2 satır ve 4 sütundan oluşan, 8 eş kare fayanstan yapılmış dikdörtgen pano. Bir fayansın kenar uzunluğu 2 üssü 3 cm.\"><rect x=\"60\" y=\"30\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"30\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"30\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"30\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"100\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"100\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"100\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"100\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"182\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"188\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"188\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2³ cm</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">Pano</text></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre panonun alanı kaç santimetrekaredir?</b></p>",
