   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Bir okulda bir haber şu kurala göre yayılmaktadır: Haberi ilk duyan 1 öğrencidir. Her 10 dakikanın sonunda, haberi bir önceki 10 dakikada yeni öğrenmiş olan her öğrenci, haberi daha önce duymamış 3 farklı öğrenciye anlatmaktadır. Haberin ilk 20 dakikadaki yayılışı aşağıdaki şemada gösterilmiştir. Şemada her daire bir öğrenciyi göstermektedir.</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 225\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ağaç şeması: başlangıçta 1 öğrenci, 10. dakikada 3 öğrenci, 20. dakikada 9 öğrenci haberi yeni öğreniyor, devamı noktalarla gösterilmiş\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"430\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"430\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"430\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"30\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"100\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"100\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"100\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"170\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"170\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"170\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"170\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"170\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"170\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"170\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"170\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"480\" cy=\"170\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">⋮</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">⋮</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">⋮</text><line x1=\"510\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"215\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"522\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0. dakika</text><text x=\"522\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\">10. dakika</text><text x=\"522\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\">20. dakika</text><text x=\"552\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">⋮</text></svg></div>\n<p><b>Buna göre 50. dakikada haberi yeni öğrenen öğrenci sayısı, 20. dakikada haberi yeni öğrenen öğrenci sayısının kaç katıdır?</b></p>",
