   "q": "<p>Kenar uzunlukları 2<sup>6</sup> cm ve 3 · 2<sup>5</sup> cm olan dikdörtgen biçimindeki bir kartonun dört köşesinden, bir kenarı 2<sup>3</sup> cm olan kare biçimindeki parçalar kesilip atılıyor (Şekil 1). Kalan kenarlar kesikli çizgilerden yukarı katlanarak üstü açık, dikdörtgenler prizması biçiminde bir kutu elde ediliyor (Şekil 2).</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 220\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Şekil 1: kenarları 3 çarpı 2 üzeri 5 cm ve 2 üzeri 6 cm olan dikdörtgen kartonun köşelerinde kesilecek kareler ve kesikli katlama çizgileri; Şekil 2: üstü açık kutu; yanında ayrıtı 2 cm olan küp şeker\"><rect x=\"60\" y=\"36\" width=\"192\" height=\"128\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"36\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><rect x=\"236\" y=\"36\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"148\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><rect x=\"236\" y=\"148\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><line x1=\"236\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3 · 2⁵ cm</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2⁶ cm</text><text x=\"156\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Şekil 1</text><polygon points=\"320,166 354,132 514,132 480,166\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"354\" y=\"132\" width=\"160\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#fcd34d\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"320,166 354,132 354,148 336,166\" fill=\"#fcd34d\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"480,166 514,132 514,148 480,182\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"166\" width=\"160\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"417\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Şekil 2</text><polygon points=\"540,150 550,140 578,140 568,150\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><polygon points=\"568,150 578,140 578,168 568,178\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"540\" y=\"150\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"559\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Küp şeker</text><text x=\"554\" y=\"196\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2 cm</text></svg></div>\n<p>Bu kutu, bir ayrıtı 2 cm olan küp şeklindeki şekerlerle hiç boşluk kalmayacak şekilde tamamen dolduruluyor.</p>\n<p><b>Buna göre kutuya kaç tane küp şeker konulmuştur?</b></p>",
