   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Kenar uzunluğu 3<sup>4</sup> m olan kare biçimindeki bir arazi, önce 9 eş kare parsele ayrılmıştır. Daha sonra sağ alttaki parsel de kendi içinde 9 eş kare parçaya ayrılmıştır. Arazinin yeşil renkle gösterilen bölümlerine sebze ekilmiştir.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 580 300\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Kenarı 3 üssü 4 metre olan kare arazi 9 eş kare parsele ayrılmış; 2 parsel yeşil. Sağ alttaki parsel de 9 eş küçük kareye ayrılmış ve bunlardan 3’ü yeşil.\"><rect x=\"170\" y=\"20\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"250\" y=\"20\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"20\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"100\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"250\" y=\"100\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"100\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"180\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"250\" y=\"180\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"180\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"330.0\" y=\"180.0\" width=\"26.67\" height=\"26.67\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"356.67\" y=\"180.0\" width=\"26.67\" height=\"26.67\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"383.33\" y=\"180.0\" width=\"26.67\" height=\"26.67\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"330.0\" y=\"206.67\" width=\"26.67\" height=\"26.67\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"356.67\" y=\"206.67\" width=\"26.67\" height=\"26.67\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"383.33\" y=\"206.67\" width=\"26.67\" height=\"26.67\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"330.0\" y=\"233.33\" width=\"26.67\" height=\"26.67\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"356.67\" y=\"233.33\" width=\"26.67\" height=\"26.67\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"383.33\" y=\"233.33\" width=\"26.67\" height=\"26.67\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"20\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"274\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"274\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"268\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"410\" y1=\"268\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"290.0\" y=\"294\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\">3⁴ m</text><rect x=\"440\" y=\"40\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#86efac\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"464\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Ekili alan</text></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre arazinin sebze ekili bölümünün alanı kaç metrekaredir?</b></p>",
