   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Kare arazi, kenar 3⁴ m; 9 eş parsel, 2 parsel yeşil.</li> <li>Sağ alt parsel 9 eş parçaya ayrılmış, 3 parça yeşil.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Sebze ekili alan (m²).</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Büyük parsel</b> Kenar 3’e bölünür. <span class=\"sv-m\">Kenar: 3⁴ ÷ 3 = 3³ m → alan (3³)² = 3⁶ m²</span></li> <li><b>Küçük parça</b> Parsel kenarı da 3’e bölünür. <span class=\"sv-m\">Kenar: 3³ ÷ 3 = 3² m → alan (3²)² = 3⁴ m²</span></li> <li><b>Ekili alanı topla</b> Ortak çarpan 3⁵ yapılır. <span class=\"sv-m\">2 · 3⁶ + 3 · 3⁴ = 2 · 3⁶ + 3⁵</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">= 6 · 3⁵ + 3⁵ = 7 · 3⁵ m² (1701)</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 300\" width=\"300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"30.0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"80.0\" height=\"80.0\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"70.0\" y=\"75.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#166534\">3⁶</text><rect x=\"110.0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"80.0\" height=\"80.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"190.0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"80.0\" height=\"80.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"30.0\" y=\"110.0\" width=\"80.0\" height=\"80.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"110.0\" y=\"110.0\" width=\"80.0\" height=\"80.0\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"155.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#166534\">3⁶</text><rect x=\"190.0\" y=\"110.0\" width=\"80.0\" height=\"80.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"30.0\" y=\"190.0\" width=\"80.0\" height=\"80.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"110.0\" y=\"190.0\" width=\"80.0\" height=\"80.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"190.0\" y=\"190.0\" width=\"26.7\" height=\"26.7\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"203.3\" y=\"207.3\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#166534\">3⁴</text><rect x=\"216.7\" y=\"190.0\" width=\"26.7\" height=\"26.7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"243.3\" y=\"190.0\" width=\"26.7\" height=\"26.7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"190.0\" y=\"216.7\" width=\"26.7\" height=\"26.7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"216.7\" y=\"216.7\" width=\"26.7\" height=\"26.7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"243.3\" y=\"216.7\" width=\"26.7\" height=\"26.7\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"256.7\" y=\"234.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#166534\">3⁴</text><rect x=\"190.0\" y=\"243.3\" width=\"26.7\" height=\"26.7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"216.7\" y=\"243.3\" width=\"26.7\" height=\"26.7\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"230.0\" y=\"260.7\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#166534\">3⁴</text><rect x=\"243.3\" y=\"243.3\" width=\"26.7\" height=\"26.7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3⁴ m</text><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\">parsel kenarı 3³</text></svg><figcaption>Büyük yeşil parsellerin her biri 3⁶ m², küçük yeşil parçaların her biri 3⁴ m².</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> 3 · 3⁴ = 3⁵ ve 2 · 3⁶ = 6 · 3⁵: hepsini aynı kuvvete getirip katsayıları topla.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Küçük parçaları büyük parsel gibi sayan 5 · 3⁶ bulur.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
