   "a": "D",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>10 özdeş kart: 2³ cm × 2⁵ cm</li> <li>Üstte 2 yatay, altta 8 dikey kart</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>KLMN’nin çevresi.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Uzun kenar</b> Üstte 2 kartın uzun kenarı yan yana. <span class=\"sv-m\">2 · 2⁵ = 2⁶ = 64 cm (alt: 8 · 2³ = 64 ✓)</span></li> <li><b>Kısa kenar</b> Yatay kartın kısa kenarı + dikey kartın uzun kenarı. Toplamada üsler toplanmaz. <span class=\"sv-m\">2³ + 2⁵ = 8 + 32 = 40 cm</span></li> <li><b>Çevre</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">2 · (64 + 40) = 208 = 13 · 2⁴ cm</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 470 280\" width=\"470\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"30\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#cffafe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"30\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#cffafe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"280\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\">2⁵</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\">2⁵</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">2³</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2 · 2⁵ = 64 cm</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2³ + 2⁵</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">= 40 cm</text></svg><figcaption>KLMN’nin kenarlarının kartlardan okunuşu.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> 208’i çarpanlarına ayır: 208 = 16 · 13 = 2⁴ · 13.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> 2³ + 2⁵’i 2⁸ sanmak; çevrede 2 ile çarpmayı unutmak.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>D</b></div></div>"
