   "a": "C",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Kurbağa 0’dan başlar; k. sıçrama (−2)ᵏ⁻¹ birim.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>6. sıçramadan sonraki konum.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Sıçramaları hesapla</b> Negatif tabanın çift kuvveti pozitif (sağa), tek kuvveti negatif (sola). <span class=\"sv-m\">1, −2, 4, −8, 16, −32</span></li> <li><b>Konumu izle</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">0 → 1 → −1 → 3 → −5 → 11 → −21</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 150\" width=\"520\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"67.0\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"67.0\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"275.0\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"275.0\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"327.0\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"327.0\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"340.0\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"340.0\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"353.0\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"353.0\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"379.0\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"379.0\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"483.0\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"483.0\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"67.0\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−21</text><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−5</text><text x=\"340.0\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><text x=\"379.0\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3</text><text x=\"483.0\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">11</text><path d=\"M340.0 100 Q346.5 76.0 353.0 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M353.0 100 Q340.0 52.0 327.0 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M327.0 100 Q353.0 28.0 379.0 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M379.0 100 Q327.0 4.0 275.0 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M275.0 100 Q379.0 -20.0 483.0 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M483.0 100 Q275.0 -44.0 67.0 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#dc2626\">6. sıçrama −32</text><circle cx=\"67.0\" cy=\"100\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7c3aed\"/><text x=\"67.0\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">bitiş</text></svg><figcaption>Yeşil sağa, kırmızı sola sıçramalar.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Toplam = 1 − 2 + 4 − 8 + 16 − 32 = −21.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> (−2)⁰’ı 0 sanmak ya da 6. sıçramada (−2)⁶ kullanmak.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
