   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Kareler: 2², 2³, 2⁴, 2⁵, 2⁶ cm; alt kenarlar hizalı, küçükten büyüğe.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Şeklin çevresi.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Çevreleyen dikdörtgen fikri</b> Basamakların yatay parçaları toplamı genişliğe, dikey parçaları toplamı en büyük karenin kenarına eşittir.</li> <li><b>Genişlik ve yükseklik</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">Genişlik: 4 + 8 + 16 + 32 + 64 = 124 = 2⁷ − 2²</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">Yükseklik: 2⁶ = 64</span></li> <li><b>Çevre</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">2 · 124 + 2 · 64 = 376</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">2⁸ − 2³ + 2⁷ = 3 · 2⁷ − 2³</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 230\" width=\"380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"179.6\" width=\"10.4\" height=\"10.4\" fill=\"#cffafe\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"30.4\" y=\"169.2\" width=\"20.8\" height=\"20.8\" fill=\"#cffafe\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"51.2\" y=\"148.4\" width=\"41.6\" height=\"41.6\" fill=\"#cffafe\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"92.8\" y=\"106.8\" width=\"83.2\" height=\"83.2\" fill=\"#cffafe\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"176.0\" y=\"23.6\" width=\"166.4\" height=\"166.4\" fill=\"#cffafe\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"23.6\" width=\"322.4\" height=\"166.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"181.2\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">genişlik 2²+…+2⁶ = 124</text><text x=\"334.4\" y=\"41.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">yükseklik 2⁶</text></svg><figcaption>Merdiven şeklin çevresi, kesikli dikdörtgenin çevresine eşit.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Karelerin çevrelerini ayrı ayrı toplayan 2⁹ − 2⁴ bulur; genişliği 2⁷ alan 3 · 2⁷ der.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
