   "q": "<p>Aşağıdaki kartlarda x, y, z ve t sayılarının üslü gösterimleri verilmiştir.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 100\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Kartlar: x = (−2) üssü −3, y = −3 üssü −2, t = −(−2) üssü −2, z = (−1/3) üssü −1.\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"120\" height=\"70\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f5f3ff\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">x =</text><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"66.0\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−2)⁻³</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"15\" width=\"120\" height=\"70\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f5f3ff\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"210.0\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">y =</text><text x=\"210.0\" y=\"66.0\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−3⁻²</text><rect x=\"285\" y=\"15\" width=\"120\" height=\"70\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f5f3ff\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"345.0\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">t =</text><text x=\"345.0\" y=\"66.0\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−(−2)⁻²</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"15\" width=\"120\" height=\"70\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f5f3ff\" stroke=\"#6d28d9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">z =</text><text x=\"460\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">(−</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1</text><line x1=\"463\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"477\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3</text><text x=\"480\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">)⁻¹</text></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre bu sayıların küçükten büyüğe doğru sıralanışı aşağıdakilerden hangisidir?</b></p>",
